%% Desktop preparation (layer 2): route recovery before a new native thread.
%% Index and code mapping: docs/dev/arch-assets.md
flowchart TD
  request["Reserved create receipt"] --> gate["Serialize preparation and probe the Desktop route"]
  gate --> ready{"Verified Desktop route?"}
  ready -->|Yes| submit["Submit the original request"]
  ready -->|No| policy{"Local recovery policy"}
  policy -->|Ask, or restart with unverified activity| waiting["Await a local decision on the same receipt"]
  waiting -->|Cancel| stopped["Not executed"]
  waiting -->|Restart or independent once| gate
  policy -->|Authorized restart or new main| main["Start native daemon if needed<br/>Gracefully quit only the approved process<br/>Launch main Desktop"]
  policy -->|Independent| independent["Start native daemon if needed<br/>Launch or reuse the independent Desktop"]
  main --> verify{"Desktop socket peer and App Server verified?"}
  independent --> verify
  verify -->|Yes| submit
  verify -->|Timeout or failure| stopped
  submit -->|Independent PID and creation token| watch["Observe recorded process"]
  watch -->|Process exited| busy{"Active turn or pending input?"}
  busy -->|Yes| running["Keep execution and offer Reopen"]
  running -->|Turn settled| release
  running -->|Reopen exact thread| watch
  busy -->|No| release["Drop Core subscription per idle thread"]
  release --> locks{"Parent and descendant writers clear?"}
  locks -->|Yes| returned["Handed back to Desktop"]
  locks -->|No| held["Report remaining holder"]
  held --> locks
